  "description": "<img width=\"25%\" src=\"https://gtif-ukif.github.io/gtif-ukif-client/assets/ucl-logo.webp\">\n\nCrop type classification mosaic covering UK and EU38 countries, cropped at the French border. Derived from Sentinel-2 imagery, this dataset maps 19 crop type classes at 10m resolution. The classification uses hierarchical codes: cereals (1110-1150), vegetables and pulses (1210-1220), tubers (1310-1320), industrial crops (1410-1440), permanent crops (2100-2320), and undecided classes (3100-3200). This is a key dataset for interactive analysis of crop-type distribution against drought indices (SPEI).",
